# Delete on the server (specs/002-manage-server-files US6): the confirmation says the entry goes to the server's trash, the entry stays in the list as
# "Delete pending" until the server has done it, and a server without a trash is not asked at all (see 09-no-trash.walk). Run after 07-move-and-copy.walk.
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
tap folderSelect
wait 400
tap folderRow 8
shot @OUT@/80-delete-selected.png
tap folderDelete
waitfor folderDeleteConfirm
expect dialogText goes to the server's trash
shot @OUT@/81-delete-confirm.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
wait 500
shot @OUT@/82-delete-pending.png
tap folderQueue
waitfor queueRow
expect queueRowCaption Not synced
tap queueSend
waitfor queueRowCaption Sent
wait 1200
shot @OUT@/83-delete-sent.png
tap queueBack
wait 500
shot @OUT@/84-documents-after-delete.png
